                                                            <comment id="1048365" author="712020:1ae810cd-615e-44e4-854d-1c1f4f70db97" created="Thu, 19 Mar 2026 07:25:26 +0800"  >&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;br/&gt;
Thank you for the plugin and your contribution.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I found a few issues during the review.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The Bug Tracker is not public. Please update the GitHub configuration to allow the public access to the Issues:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://moodle.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/214690&quot; alt=&quot;image-20260318-232107.png&quot; width=&quot;334&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;I have the error during the installation:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;ddl_exception thrown with message &quot;XML database file errors found&quot;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Stacktrace:&lt;br/&gt;
#4 ddl_exception in /var/www/html/moodle.local/moodle/lib/ddl/database_manager.php:354&lt;br/&gt;
#3 database_manager:load_xmldb_file in /var/www/html/moodle.local/moodle/lib/ddl/database_manager.php:370&lt;br/&gt;
#2 database_manager:install_from_xmldb_file in /var/www/html/moodle.local/moodle/lib/upgradelib.php:735&lt;br/&gt;
#1 upgrade_plugins in /var/www/html/moodle.local/moodle/lib/upgradelib.php:1943&lt;br/&gt;
#0 upgrade_noncore in /var/www/html/moodle.local/moodle/admin/index.php:719&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please remove the unnecessary install.xml file, as the tables list is empty, which causes an error during installation.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://moodle.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/214688&quot; alt=&quot;image-20260318-232229.png&quot; width=&quot;435&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The Backup/Restore is not correctly implemented. The customfield plugin type does not require the backup/restore files.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://moodle.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/214691&quot; alt=&quot;image-20260318-232354.png&quot; width=&quot;476&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;4. Please consider reviewing the plugin logic. I found a case which breaks the functionality. When the option includes the comma, this option does not save in the DB.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://moodle.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/214689&quot; alt=&quot;image-20260318-232509.png&quot; width=&quot;280&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please address the reported issues and resubmit the plugin for review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                                                            <comment id="1048372" author="557058:d7957271-3ea7-475a-a64a-347ce68eb099" created="Thu, 19 Mar 2026 08:09:06 +0800"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://moodle.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A1ae810cd-615e-44e4-854d-1c1f4f70db97&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;712020:1ae810cd-615e-44e4-854d-1c1f4f70db97&quot; data-account-id=&quot;712020:1ae810cd-615e-44e4-854d-1c1f4f70db97&quot; accountid=&quot;712020:1ae810cd-615e-44e4-854d-1c1f4f70db97&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot;&gt;Volodymyr Dovhan&lt;/a&gt; Thank you for the feedback and the quick turnaround. I will make these changes and resubmit.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Darrel&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
